        "text": "Add Your Endorsement\n# Add Your Endorsement\n### Your endorsement is more powerful than you think.\nWhen your neighbors see your name supporting Joel, it helps build trust and momentum for the campaign. Stand with Joel and help strengthen our community.\nYour name will be featured on this page\nYour endorsement will be shared with the community\nYou will be the first to know about listening tour events and updates\nYour support helps this movement grow one neighbor at a time\n## Voices of Support",
