        "text": "# Support Joel for San Ramon Valley School Board\nEvery great campaign is built by people who believe change is possible. Here's how you can help:\n## Support\n## Not Ready to Give?\nYour time is just as valuable. Join the team to knock on doors, host a conversation, or help spread the word throughout the community.\nVolunteer with the campaign\n## Who Can Contribute\nU.S. citizens and lawful permanent residents may contribute\nYour employer and occupation are required with every contribution\nCash contributions over $100 are not permitted\nNo corporate, business, or organizational contributions accepted\nNo contributions from foreign nationals or temporary visa holders\nContributions to Joel Woods are not tax-deductible for federal or state income tax purposes\nPaid for by Joel Woods",
